{"title": "Courts impose lengthy sentences in separate POCSO and pre-trial detention cases", "summary": "In Odisha, a father received a 20-year sentence under the POCSO Act for what a court termed an 'unspeakable betrayal of trust'. Separately, in Kerala, a man spent 39 years as a remand prisoner without trial, a period exceeding twice the potential sentence for murder. Another Kerala man, a cricket coach, faces an accumulated 35-year jail term across three POCSO verdicts.", "summary_points": ["Odisha court sentenced a father to 20 years rigorous imprisonment under POCSO.", "The court described the crime as an 'unspeakable betrayal of trust'.", "A Kerala man was held for 39 years without trial, exceeding a potential murder sentence.", "A Kerala cricket coach received a cumulative 35-year sentence across three POCSO convictions."], "title_hi": "POCSO और विचार-पूर्व हिरासत मामलों में अदालतों द्वारा लंबी सजाएं", "summary_hi": "ओडिशा में, एक पिता को POCSO अधिनियम के तहत 20 साल की कठोर कैद की सजा सुनाई गई, जिसे अदालत ने 'अविश्वसनीय विश्वासघात' बताया। अलग से, केरल में, एक व्यक्ति ने मुकदमे के बिना 39 साल रिमांड कैदी के रूप में बिताए, जो हत्या की संभावित सजा से लगभग दोगुना है। एक अन्य केरल व्यक्ति, एक क्रिकेट कोच, को तीन POCSO फैसलों में कुल 35 साल की जेल की सजा का सामना करना पड़ रहा है।", "summary_points_hi": ["ओडिशा की अदालत ने POCSO के तहत एक पिता को 20 साल की कठोर कैद की सजा सुनाई।", "अदालत ने अपराध को 'अविश्वसनीय विश्वासघात' बताया।", "केरल के एक व्यक्ति को मुकदमे के बिना 39 साल तक हिरासत में रखा गया, जो संभावित हत्या की सजा से अधिक है।", "केरल के एक क्रिकेट कोच को तीन POCSO फैसलों में कुल 35 साल की सजा मिली।"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist outlets highlight the severity of sentences in POCSO cases and the prolonged pre-trial detention, emphasizing the legal outcomes and the duration of punishment or detention."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "मध्यमार्गी आउटलेट POCSO मामलों में सजा की गंभीरता और मुकदमे से पहले लंबी हिरासत पर प्रकाश डालते हैं, जो कानूनी परिणामों और सजा या हिरासत की अवधि पर जोर देते हैं।"}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://images.indianexpress.com/2026/03/Supriya-Sule-3col.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "LiveLaw", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "'Unspeakable Betrayal Of Trust': Odisha POCSO Court Sentences Father To 20 Years Rigorous Imprisonment..."}, {"source": "National Herald", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Delhi man gets life term 12 years after killing vendor over ‘jalebi’ queue dispute"}, {"source": "Mathrubhumi English", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Kerala man spends 39 years as remand prisoner without trial, almost twice possible murder sentence"}, {"source": "Mathrubhumi English", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Third POCSO verdict against Kerala cricket coach; effective jail term climbs to 35 years"}, {"source": "LiveLaw", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "'Child's Dignity Was Shattered': Odisha Court Sentences Tutor To 20-Years Imprisonment For Sexually..."}, {"source": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/shorts/watch-pune-rape-murder-case-court-awards-death-penalty-to-65-year-old-convict/article71160840.ece", "headline": "Watch: Pune rape-murder case: Court awards death penalty to 65-year-old convict"}, {"source": "The Indian Express", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/cities/pune/pune-rape-murder-case-supriya-sule-sunetra-pawar-death-sentence-10762884", "headline": "‘Real justice when the beast is hanged’: Supriya Sule on Pune rape-murder death sentence"}, {"source": "Mint", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/death-penalty-for-64-year-old-bhimrao-kamble-in-pune-childs-rape-and-murd